WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.218 --> 00:00:03.519
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHAT I CAN'T BELIEVE.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.056
AND YOU ARE THEIR STAR WITNESS.

00:00:07.057 --> 00:00:09.192
JOINING ME NOW IS JEFF SESSIONS,

00:00:09.193 --> 00:00:09.926
FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL, AND IT

00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:12.462
NOW AGAIN FOR A U.S. SENATE OF

00:00:12.463 --> 00:00:13.095
ALABAMA.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.832
WHAT IS YOUR BIG TAKE AWAY FROM

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:16.132
TODAY?

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:19.602
&gt;&gt; IT CERTAINLY TO ME -- I AGREE

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:20.703
WITH KEN STARR.

00:00:20.704 --> 00:00:22.872
THIS IS A VERY SERIOUS TIME FOR

00:00:22.873 --> 00:00:23.206
AMERICA.

00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:27.243
IT DOES NOT APPEAR TO ME THAT

00:00:27.244 --> 00:00:28.978
THEY HAVE THE KIND OF EVIDENCE

00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:30.480
THAT WOULD JUSTIFY GOING

00:00:30.481 --> 00:00:30.980
FORWARD.

00:00:30.981 --> 00:00:33.449
I CALLED IT A SHOW TRIAL.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:33.983
WHAT'S A SHOW TRIAL?

00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:39.589
WHEN YOU DECIDED THAT LOOKS

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.760
GUILTY.

00:00:44.761 --> 00:00:45.461
AND THIS IS THE KIND OF THING

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:46.195
THAT I THINK IS CONCERNING TO A

00:00:46.196 --> 00:00:47.029
LOT OF PEOPLE.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.097
THE CONSTITUTION SAYS

00:00:48.098 --> 00:00:49.332
IMPEACHMENT IS NOT ANYTHING

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:49.999
CONGRESS SAYS IT IS, IT SAYS

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.704
IT'S FOR CONVICTION OF TREASON

00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:56.539
AND BRIBERY, HIGH CRIMES AND

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:56.973
MISDEMEANORS.

00:00:56.974 --> 00:01:00.943
THOSE ARE RESTRAINING LAWS IN

00:01:00.944 --> 00:01:03.646
OUR CONSTITUTION THAT RESTRAINS

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:04.313
CONGRESS AND THEY NEED TO BE

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:06.616
FAITHFUL TO THEIR

00:01:06.617 --> 00:01:08.184
RESPONSIBILITIES AND,

00:01:08.185 --> 00:01:10.119
FUNDAMENTAL ANALYSTS URGE OUR

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.220
DEMOCRATIC MEMBERS OF CONGRESS

00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.255
TO THINK DEEPLY ABOUT THE FUTURE

00:01:12.256 --> 00:01:13.689
OF THIS COUNTRY AND THE DANGER

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:17.960
TO THIS REPUBLIC THAT WOULD

00:01:17.961 --> 00:01:19.529
OCCUR IF WE CONTINUE TO

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:20.162
PROSECUTE PEOPLE BASICALLY

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:24.200
BECAUSE WE DON'T LIKE THEM OR WE

00:01:24.201 --> 00:01:26.168
HAVE A POLITICAL DISAGREEMENT.

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:28.170
&gt;&gt; Laura: SENATOR, WHAT MORE

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:30.606
CAN THE MEMBERS OF REPUBLICAN

00:01:30.607 --> 00:01:31.374
PARTY SERVING IN CONGRESS TODAY

00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:33.543
DO FOR THIS PRESIDENT AND FOR

00:01:33.544 --> 00:01:36.212
HIS AGENDA THAT THEY ARE NOT

00:01:36.213 --> 00:01:38.147
DOING PERHAPS?

00:01:38.148 --> 00:01:39.715
MAYBE A LITTLE ADVICE OF WHAT

00:01:39.716 --> 00:01:40.583
THEY CAN DO BETTER OR MORE TO

00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:42.852
HELP THIS ADMINISTRATION?

00:01:42.853 --> 00:01:44.153
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO TAKE THE CASE TO

00:01:44.154 --> 00:01:46.856
THE PEOPLE.

00:01:46.857 --> 00:01:49.559
BASED ON ALL THE ISSUES HE'S

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:53.195
ADVOCATING, STANDING UP TO

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:56.165
CHINA, BEING PART OF THE

00:01:56.166 --> 00:02:01.537
DEPLOYMENT, ON THIS IMPEACHMENT,

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:04.040
I THINK THEY'VE GOT TO SPEAK OUT

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:04.974
PRETTY AGGRESSIVELY AND SAY,

00:02:04.975 --> 00:02:05.474
WHERE'S THE BEEF.

00:02:05.475 --> 00:02:09.145
WHAT IS THE CHARGE.

00:02:09.146 --> 00:02:10.746
DOES IT MEET THE CONSTITUTIONAL

00:02:10.747 --> 00:02:11.480
STANDARDS AND, I THINK WE HAVE A

00:02:11.481 --> 00:02:16.919
LOT OF MEMBERS THAT ARE.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:21.524
SO REPUBLICANS NEED TO BE

00:02:21.525 --> 00:02:22.792
CONFIDENT THAT IF THE EVIDENCE

00:02:22.793 --> 00:02:23.492
DOES NOT SUPPORT IMPEACHMENT

00:02:23.493 --> 00:02:28.230
THEY WILL THEY ARE PERFECTLY

00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:33.536
SAFE.

00:02:33.537 --> 00:02:36.205
&gt;&gt; SENATOR, ARE YOU IN

00:02:36.206 --> 00:02:37.740
RETROSPECT, WE ALL LOOK BACK ON

00:02:37.741 --> 00:02:38.341
DECISIONS WE MADE.

00:02:38.342 --> 00:02:39.108
ARE YOU GLAD YOU LEFT THE SENATE

00:02:39.109 --> 00:02:43.079
TO GO WORK IN THE SENATE

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:43.546
ADMINISTRATION?

00:02:43.547 --> 00:02:46.882
&gt;&gt; I DON'T LOOK BACK ON THOSE

00:02:46.883 --> 00:02:47.350
KIND OF MATTERS.

00:02:47.351 --> 00:02:48.451
WE MADE A DECISION I THOUGHT WAS

00:02:48.452 --> 00:02:49.719
RIGHT AT THE TIME AND A LOT OF

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.320
PEOPLE THINK ALL WE DID WAS DEAL

00:02:51.321 --> 00:02:52.922
WITH RUSSIA BUT WE HAD A

00:02:52.923 --> 00:02:57.426
TREMENDOUS REVITALIZATION OF

00:02:57.427 --> 00:02:58.494
FEDERAL CRIMINAL PROSECUTIONS

00:02:58.495 --> 00:02:59.095
THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY.

00:02:59.096 --> 00:03:02.064
HER REVITALIZATION OF

00:03:02.065 --> 00:03:03.833
PARTNERSHIPS WITH OUR STATE AND

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:04.333
LOCAL ALLIES.

00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:06.102
WE STOOD OUT FOR RELIGIOUS

00:03:06.103 --> 00:03:08.270
LIBERTY AND WE HELP TO THE

00:03:08.271 --> 00:03:09.972
PRESIDENT APPOINT THE BEST GROUP

00:03:09.973 --> 00:03:10.673
OF FEDERAL JOINTED STOMACH

00:03:10.674 --> 00:03:12.942
JUDGES THAT HAD EVER BEEN

00:03:12.943 --> 00:03:15.344
APPOINTED.

00:03:15.345 --> 00:03:19.982
THERE WAS SO MUCH, WE STARTED A

00:03:19.983 --> 00:03:22.685
NEW GROUP TO INTENSIFY OUR

00:03:22.686 --> 00:03:25.554
EFFORTS TO PROSECUTE FRAUD AND

00:03:25.555 --> 00:03:28.157
THE I.T. NETWORKS AND

00:03:28.158 --> 00:03:29.692
PARTICULARLY CHINA.

00:03:29.693 --> 00:03:32.561
A LOT OF GOOD THINGS OCCURRED,

00:03:32.562 --> 00:03:34.163
AND I KNEW A LOT ABOUT IT BUT I

00:03:34.164 --> 00:03:36.432
FELT LIKE WE WERE DOING A

00:03:36.433 --> 00:03:39.568
GOOD JOB.

00:03:39.569 --> 00:03:41.604
WE HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO SEEK

00:03:41.605 --> 00:03:43.806
THE SENATE SEAT AGAIN AND I

00:03:43.807 --> 00:03:46.242
WOULD BE PLEASED.

00:03:46.243 --> 00:03:50.980
&gt;&gt; IF YOU COULD -- THE PRESIDENT

00:03:50.981 --> 00:03:52.148
VOCATIONALLY WATCHES THE SHOW,

00:03:52.149 --> 00:03:53.382
ANYTHING YOU'D LIKE TO SAY TO

00:03:53.383 --> 00:03:53.983
THEM TONIGHT?

00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:55.518
&gt;&gt; HE DIDN'T HAVE A BETTER

00:03:55.519 --> 00:03:56.652
SUPPORTER IN THE UNITED STATES

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:58.020
SENATE THEN WHEN I WAS THERE.

00:03:58.021 --> 00:04:01.257
I WAS HIS FIRST SUPPORTER IN THE

00:04:01.258 --> 00:04:10.032
UNITED STATES SENATE, BUT, --

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:12.668
WHAT DO YOU SAY TO THOSE

00:04:12.669 --> 00:04:14.704
REPUBLICANS?

00:04:14.705 --> 00:04:16.205
THIS PRESIDENT, HE'S NOT A REAL

00:04:16.206 --> 00:04:17.106
CONSERVATIVE.

00:04:17.107 --> 00:04:18.307
HE'S NOT REALLY DOING THE

00:04:18.308 --> 00:04:18.841
CONSERVATIVE THING.

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:21.744
HE'S NOT BRINGING THE MOVEMENT

00:04:21.745 --> 00:04:22.712
ALONG, HE SPENDING TOO MUCH TIME

00:04:22.713 --> 00:04:23.679
ON THE SIDE FIGHTS.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.949
WHAT DO YOU SAY TO THEM?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.585
&gt;&gt; I TELL YOU THIS PRESIDENT HAS

00:04:29.586 --> 00:04:31.287
MOVED A CONSERVATIVE AGENDA IN A

00:04:31.288 --> 00:04:32.922
HOST OF AREAS.

00:04:32.923 --> 00:04:33.889
HE CUT TAXES.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:34.824
ISN'T THAT CONSERVATIVE?

00:04:34.825 --> 00:04:36.826
HE STANDS UP FOR AMERICA FIRST

00:04:36.827 --> 00:04:37.393
THROUGHOUT THE WORLD.

00:04:37.394 --> 00:04:41.697
ISN'T THAT GOOD?

00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:42.465
DEFENDING AMERICAN MANUFACTURING

00:04:42.466 --> 00:04:43.799
AGAINST CHEATING BY CHINA, I

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:47.069
KNOW THE COUNTRY.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:50.005
HE'S TRYING TO DEFEND OUR

00:04:50.006 --> 00:04:51.373
BORDERS AND THAT'S A WAY THAT

00:04:51.374 --> 00:04:53.409
AFFECTS THE RULE OF LAW IN

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:53.743
AMERICA.

00:04:53.744 --> 00:04:54.310
I JUST THINK HE'S BEEN

00:04:54.311 --> 00:05:00.149
CONSERVATIVE CONSISTENTLY.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.685
BUT MOST IMPORTANTLY, HE'S BEEN

00:05:02.686 --> 00:05:04.186
EFFECTIVE AND FAITHFUL IN WHAT

00:05:04.187 --> 00:05:06.188
HE PROMISED.

00:05:06.189 --> 00:05:07.490
HE TOLD THE AMERICAN PEOPLE WHAT

00:05:07.491 --> 00:05:09.425
HE WOULD DEAL, AND A LOT OF

00:05:09.426 --> 00:05:11.127
PEOPLE DOUBTED HE WOULD DO IT,

00:05:11.128 --> 00:05:12.261
BUT HE'S DONE IT BETTER THAN

00:05:12.262 --> 00:05:14.830
ALMOST ANY PRESIDENT IN A MY

00:05:14.831 --> 00:05:15.364
LIFETIME.

00:05:15.365 --> 00:05:16.732
&gt;&gt; Laura: AND SENATOR, I KNOW

00:05:16.733 --> 00:05:19.235
HE HAD SOME CHOICE WORDS FOR YOU

00:05:19.236 --> 00:05:22.738
MOSTLY BECAUSE OF THE MUELLER

00:05:22.739 --> 00:05:23.372
DEAL AND ROSENSTEIN.

00:05:23.373 --> 00:05:26.408
BUT DO YOU THINK YOU WILL

00:05:26.409 --> 00:05:27.643
ULTIMATELY GET HIS ENDORSEMENT?

00:05:27.644 --> 00:05:29.078
&gt;&gt; I HOPE SO.

00:05:29.079 --> 00:05:30.079
CERTAINLY I'M GOING TO WORK FOR

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:33.182
THAT AND WE WILL BE SEEKING IT.

00:05:33.183 --> 00:05:35.384
HE DOESN'T ALWAYS GET INVOLVED

00:05:35.385 --> 00:05:36.819
IN PRIMARY SO I UNDERSTAND THAT

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:38.888
AND HE HAS INDICATED HE PROBABLY

00:05:38.889 --> 00:05:40.055
WOULD NOT IN THIS ONE.

00:05:40.056 --> 00:05:41.190
BUT YES.

00:05:41.191 --> 00:05:43.092
I WOULD LOVE TO HAVE HIS

00:05:43.093 --> 00:05:43.425
SUPPORT.

00:05:43.426 --> 00:05:46.428
I ASK PEOPLE FIRST, I HAVE SOME

00:05:46.429 --> 00:05:48.731
PEOPLE OF ALABAMA AND THROUGHOUT

00:05:48.732 --> 00:05:50.499
THE COUNTRY TO TRUST HIM AND

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:50.966
SUPPORT HIM.

00:05:50.967 --> 00:05:52.902
I THOUGHT HE WAS THE ONE WHO

00:05:52.903 --> 00:05:54.303
COULD WIN AND IF YOU WIN, I

00:05:54.304 --> 00:05:56.172
THOUGHT HE COULD BRING THAT

00:05:56.173 --> 00:06:00.209
DRIVE, THAT ENERGY, THAT WILL

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.811
BECAUSE IT'S EXTRAORDINARY, TO

00:06:01.812 --> 00:06:02.344
ADVANCE HIS AGENDA.

00:06:02.345 --> 00:06:04.513
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU ARE ABSOLUTELY

00:06:04.514 --> 00:06:08.018
RIGHT.

